From: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] meson: find wayland-scanner from native PATH

The wayland-scanner pkg-config file exposes /usr/bin/wayland-scanner for
target-side consumers. Resolve the native build tool through PATH instead.

Upstream-Status: Pending

---
 src/meson.build | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -116 +116 @@
-    wayland_scanner = find_program(wayland_scanner_dep.get_pkgconfig_variable('wayland_scanner'))
+    wayland_scanner = find_program('wayland-scanner')
